        "offset": 829
      },
      "text": "void list_add(struct list_node *head, struct list_node *n)\n{\n\tn-\u003enext = head-\u003enext;\n\tn-\u003eprev = head;\n\thead-\u003enext-\u003eprev = n;\n\thead-\u003enext = n;\n}",
