      "text": "entry_t *registry_find(const registry_t *r, const char *name)\n{\n\tfor (size_t i = 0; i \u003c r-\u003elen; i++) {\n\t\tentry_t *e = r-\u003eitems[i];\n\t\tif (strcmp(e-\u003ename, name) == 0 \u0026\u0026 e-\u003ekind != KIND_STRING)\n\t\t\treturn e;\n\t}\n\tlog_debug(\"not found: %s\", name);\n\treturn NULL;\n}",
